  "evidencia": "Page: Blagsnarst, a Love Story. Sentence: \"Blagsnarst, a Love Story\" is the third episode and season finale of the eleventh season of \"American Dad!\nPage: Blagsnarst, a Love Story. Sentence: \" The episode aired on September 21, 2014, and is the final show to air on Fox's Animation Domination lineup, as well as the final episode of the series to be aired on Fox as the show moved to TBS from the twelfth season onwards, which started a month later in October 2014.\nPage: Animation Domination. Sentence: The block aired on Sunday evenings through the entirety of that night's primetime schedule (unless preempted, usually by sports telecasts).",
